  "name": {
    "en": "A3 Struma Motorway"
  },
  "description": {
    "en": "A 172.8 km motorway in southwestern Bulgaria running Sofia–Pernik–Blagoevgrad–Kresna–Kulata, from the capital to the Greek border on Pan-European Corridor IV (European route E-79). Its lots opened between 2013 and 2024; the Kresna Gorge bypass (Lot 3.2) was still under construction as of 2026."
